{"seq":3,"slug":"io-and-streams","title":"IO 与流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/foundations/io-and-streams","wordCount":865,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"io-与流\">IO 与流</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>IO 与流</strong>（IO &amp; Streams）描述 CLI 程序如何与外界交换数据。核心心智模型是三个<strong>标准流</strong>：stdin 接收输入、stdout 输出结果、stderr 输出诊断信息。分清&quot;结果&quot;与&quot;诊断&quot;是可组合性的第一道门槛。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>关键约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标准流</td>\n<td>程序与外界的三条通道</td>\n<td>结果走 stdout，日志走 stderr</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>管道/重定向</td>\n<td>重新连接流的去向</td>\n<td>不改变程序，只改变连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TTY 检测</td>\n<td>判断是否运行在交互终端</td>\n<td>非 TTY 时自动降级为纯文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓冲</td>\n<td>批量系统调用提升性能</td>\n<td>大文件避免一次性读入内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构化输出</td>\n<td>让结果可被程序消费</td>\n<td>提供 <code>--json</code> 等机器可读格式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个工具只要正确处理这五点，就能同时服务人类用户和下游脚本。本文从标准流讲到缓冲与结构化输出。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"三大标准流\">三大标准流</h2><p>每个 CLI 程序都与三个<strong>标准流</strong>（Standard Streams）相连，它们是程序与外界沟通的基本通道。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>流</th>\n<th>文件描述符</th>\n<th>默认目标</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>stdin</strong></td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>键盘</td>\n<td>接收输入数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>stdout</strong></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>终端</td>\n<td>输出程序结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>stderr</strong></td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>终端</td>\n<td>输出错误和诊断信息</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[键盘/管道] --&gt;|stdin fd=0| B[CLI 程序]&#10;    B --&gt;|stdout fd=1| C[终端/管道/文件]&#10;    B --&gt;|stderr fd=2| D[终端]\">graph LR\n    A[键盘/管道] --&gt;|stdin fd=0| B[CLI 程序]\n    B --&gt;|stdout fd=1| C[终端/管道/文件]\n    B --&gt;|stderr fd=2| D[终端]</pre><p>正确区分 stdout 和 stderr 是构建可组合 CLI 工具的基础原则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn main() {&#10;    let result = process_data();&#10;    match result {&#10;        Ok(output) =&gt; println!(&quot;{}&quot;, output),&#10;        Err(e) =&gt; {&#10;            eprintln!(&quot;错误: {}&quot;, e);&#10;            std::process::exit(1);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn process_data() -&gt; Result&lt;String, String&gt; {&#10;    Ok(&quot;处理结果输出到 stdout&quot;.to_string())&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let result = process_data();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match result {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(output) => println!(\"{}\", output),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Err(e) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            eprintln!(\"错误: {}\", e);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            std::process::exit(1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn process_data() -> Result&#x3C;String, String> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(\"处理结果输出到 stdout\".to_string())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 永远将程序的正式输出发送到 stdout，将日志、进度和错误信息发送到 stderr。这样用户才能通过管道只捕获有用的数据。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"管道与重定向\">管道与重定向</h2><p><strong>管道</strong>（Pipe）是 Unix 工具链的核心机制，将一个程序的 stdout 连接到另一个程序的 stdin。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>管道</td>\n<td><code>cmd1 | cmd2</code></td>\n<td>stdout → stdin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出重定向</td>\n<td><code>cmd &gt; file</code></td>\n<td>stdout → 文件（覆盖）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>追加重定向</td>\n<td><code>cmd &gt;&gt; file</code></td>\n<td>stdout → 文件（追加）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误重定向</td>\n<td><code>cmd 2&gt; file</code></td>\n<td>stderr → 文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并重定向</td>\n<td><code>cmd 2&gt;&amp;1</code></td>\n<td>stderr → stdout</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输入重定向</td>\n<td><code>cmd &lt; file</code></td>\n<td>文件 → stdin</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::io::{self, BufRead, Write, BufWriter};&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let stdin = io::stdin();&#10;    let stdout = io::stdout();&#10;    let mut writer = BufWriter::new(stdout.lock());&#10;&#10;    let mut line_num = 0;&#10;    for line in stdin.lock().lines() {&#10;        let line = line.unwrap();&#10;        line_num += 1;&#10;        writeln!(writer, &quot;{:&gt;4} | {}&quot;, line_num, line).unwrap();&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::io::{self, BufRead, Write, BufWriter};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let stdin = io::stdin();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let stdout = io::stdout();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut writer = BufWriter::new(stdout.lock());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut line_num = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for line in stdin.lock().lines() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let line = line.unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        line_num += 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        writeln!(writer, \"{:>4} | {}\", line_num, line).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>使用示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"cat src/main.rs | mytool          # 从管道读取&#10;mytool &lt; input.txt                # 从文件重定向&#10;mytool &lt; input.txt &gt; output.txt   # 同时重定向输入输出\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/main.rs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> mytool</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # 从管道读取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mytool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> input.txt</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                # 从文件重定向</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mytool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> input.txt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> output.txt</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # 同时重定向输入输出</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"tty-检测\">TTY 检测</h2><p><strong>TTY</strong>（Teletypewriter）检测用于判断程序是否在交互式终端中运行。这一信息决定了是否输出颜色、是否显示进度条等行为。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::io::IsTerminal;&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let stdin_is_tty = std::io::stdin().is_terminal();&#10;    let stdout_is_tty = std::io::stdout().is_terminal();&#10;&#10;    if stdout_is_tty {&#10;        println!(&quot;\\x1b[32m✓ 运行在交互式终端\\x1b[0m&quot;);&#10;    } else {&#10;        println!(&quot;✓ 运行在交互式终端&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if stdin_is_tty {&#10;        eprintln!(&quot;等待用户输入...&quot;);&#10;    } else {&#10;        eprintln!(&quot;从管道读取数据...&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::io::IsTerminal;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let stdin_is_tty = std::io::stdin().is_terminal();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let stdout_is_tty = std::io::stdout().is_terminal();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if stdout_is_tty {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"\\x1b[32m✓ 运行在交互式终端\\x1b[0m\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"✓ 运行在交互式终端\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if stdin_is_tty {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        eprintln!(\"等待用户输入...\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        eprintln!(\"从管道读取数据...\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>stdin</th>\n<th>stdout</th>\n<th>行为调整</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交互式</td>\n<td>TTY</td>\n<td>TTY</td>\n<td>彩色输出，显示进度条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>管道输出</td>\n<td>TTY</td>\n<td>非 TTY</td>\n<td>禁用颜色，纯文本输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>管道输入</td>\n<td>非 TTY</td>\n<td>TTY</td>\n<td>从管道读取，正常显示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全管道</td>\n<td>非 TTY</td>\n<td>非 TTY</td>\n<td>纯文本，无交互</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 大多数颜色库（如 <code>owo-colors</code>、<code>chalk</code>）自带 TTY 检测，但你仍需在自定义格式化逻辑中手动处理。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"流式处理与缓冲\">流式处理与缓冲</h2><p>高效的 IO 处理需要理解<strong>缓冲</strong>（Buffering）机制。Rust 标准库提供了 <code>BufReader</code> 和 <code>BufWriter</code> 来优化 IO 性能。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::io::{self, Read, BufRead, BufReader, Write, BufWriter};&#10;use std::fs::File;&#10;&#10;fn count_matches(path: Option&lt;&amp;str&gt;, pattern: &amp;str) -&gt; io::Result&lt;usize&gt; {&#10;    let reader: Box&lt;dyn BufRead&gt; = match path {&#10;        Some(p) =&gt; Box::new(BufReader::new(File::open(p)?)),&#10;        None =&gt; Box::new(BufReader::new(io::stdin().lock())),&#10;    };&#10;&#10;    let mut count = 0;&#10;    for line in reader.lines() {&#10;        let line = line?;&#10;        if line.contains(pattern) {&#10;            count += 1;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;    Ok(count)&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let args: Vec&lt;String&gt; = std::env::args().collect();&#10;    let pattern = args.get(1).expect(&quot;用法: mytool &lt;pattern&gt; [file]&quot;);&#10;    let path = args.get(2).map(|s| s.as_str());&#10;&#10;    match count_matches(path, pattern) {&#10;        Ok(n) =&gt; println!(&quot;{}&quot;, n),&#10;        Err(e) =&gt; {&#10;            eprintln!(&quot;错误: {}&quot;, e);&#10;            std::process::exit(1);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::io::{self, Read, BufRead, BufReader, Write, BufWriter};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::fs::File;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn count_matches(path: Option&#x3C;&#x26;str>, pattern: &#x26;str) -> io::Result&#x3C;usize> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let reader: Box&#x3C;dyn BufRead> = match path {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Some(p) => Box::new(BufReader::new(File::open(p)?)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        None => Box::new(BufReader::new(io::stdin().lock())),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut count = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for line in reader.lines() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let line = line?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if line.contains(pattern) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            count += 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(count)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let args: Vec&#x3C;String> = std::env::args().collect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let pattern = args.get(1).expect(\"用法: mytool &#x3C;pattern> [file]\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let path = args.get(2).map(|s| s.as_str());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match count_matches(path, pattern) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(n) => println!(\"{}\", n),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Err(e) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            eprintln!(\"错误: {}\", e);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            std::process::exit(1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[原始 IO] --&gt;|每次系统调用| B[性能差]&#10;    C[BufReader/BufWriter] --&gt;|批量系统调用| D[性能好]&#10;    E[逐行读取] --&gt;|内存可控| F[适合大文件]&#10;    G[read_to_string] --&gt;|全部加载到内存| H[不适合大文件]\">graph TD\n    A[原始 IO] --&gt;|每次系统调用| B[性能差]\n    C[BufReader/BufWriter] --&gt;|批量系统调用| D[性能好]\n    E[逐行读取] --&gt;|内存可控| F[适合大文件]\n    G[read_to_string] --&gt;|全部加载到内存| H[不适合大文件]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"结构化输出\">结构化输出</h2><p>现代 CLI 工具常需支持多种输出格式，以适应不同的消费场景。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use serde::Serialize;&#10;&#10;#[derive(Serialize)]&#10;struct FileInfo {&#10;    name: String,&#10;    size: u64,&#10;    modified: String,&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn format_output(files: &amp;[FileInfo], json: bool) {&#10;    if json {&#10;        println!(&quot;{}&quot;, serde_json::to_string_pretty(files).unwrap());&#10;    } else {&#10;        println!(&quot;{:&lt;30} {:&gt;10} {}&quot;, &quot;名称&quot;, &quot;大小&quot;, &quot;修改时间&quot;);&#10;        println!(&quot;{}&quot;, &quot;-&quot;.repeat(60));&#10;        for f in files {&#10;            println!(&quot;{:&lt;30} {:&gt;10} {}&quot;, f.name, f.size, f.modified);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let files = vec![&#10;        FileInfo { name: &quot;main.rs&quot;.into(), size: 1234, modified: &quot;2026-04-01&quot;.into() },&#10;        FileInfo { name: &quot;lib.rs&quot;.into(), size: 5678, modified: &quot;2026-03-30&quot;.into() },&#10;    ];&#10;    let use_json = std::env::args().any(|a| a == &quot;--json&quot;);&#10;    format_output(&amp;files, use_json);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use serde::Serialize;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(Serialize)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct FileInfo {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    size: u64,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    modified: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn format_output(files: &#x26;[FileInfo], json: bool) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if json {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"{}\", serde_json::to_string_pretty(files).unwrap());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"{:&#x3C;30} {:>10} {}\", \"名称\", \"大小\", \"修改时间\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"{}\", \"-\".repeat(60));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for f in files {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            println!(\"{:&#x3C;30} {:>10} {}\", f.name, f.size, f.modified);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let files = vec![</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        FileInfo { name: \"main.rs\".into(), size: 1234, modified: \"2026-04-01\".into() },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        FileInfo { name: \"lib.rs\".into(), size: 5678, modified: \"2026-03-30\".into() },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let use_json = std::env::args().any(|a| a == \"--json\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    format_output(&#x26;files, use_json);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>输出格式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>纯文本</td>\n<td>人类阅读</td>\n<td><code>println!</code> 格式化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JSON</td>\n<td>程序消费/jq 处理</td>\n<td><code>serde_json</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CSV/TSV</td>\n<td>表格数据导出</td>\n<td><code>csv</code> crate</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表格</td>\n<td>终端美观展示</td>\n<td><code>tabled</code> crate</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((IO 与流))&#10;    标准流&#10;      stdin 输入&#10;      stdout 结果&#10;      stderr 诊断&#10;    管道&#10;      cmd1 → cmd2&#10;      重定向到文件&#10;    TTY 检测&#10;      交互式终端&#10;      管道模式&#10;      颜色降级&#10;    缓冲&#10;      BufReader&#10;      BufWriter&#10;      流式处理&#10;    结构化输出&#10;      纯文本&#10;      JSON&#10;      表格\">mindmap\n  root((IO 与流))\n    标准流\n      stdin 输入\n      stdout 结果\n      stderr 诊断\n    管道\n      cmd1 → cmd2\n      重定向到文件\n    TTY 检测\n      交互式终端\n      管道模式\n      颜色降级\n    缓冲\n      BufReader\n      BufWriter\n      流式处理\n    结构化输出\n      纯文本\n      JSON\n      表格</pre><ul>\n<li>stdin/stdout/stderr 三个标准流各有明确职责，正确使用是可组合性的前提</li>\n<li>管道和重定向让简单工具通过组合产生强大能力</li>\n<li>TTY 检测决定了颜色、进度条等交互元素的开关，非 TTY 环境应自动降级</li>\n<li>BufReader/BufWriter 是高性能 IO 的基础，避免对大文件使用 read_to_string</li>\n<li>支持 <code>--json</code> 等结构化输出格式，让工具既能服务人类也能服务程序</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"IO 与流","id":"io-与流"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三大标准流","id":"三大标准流"},{"level":2,"text":"管道与重定向","id":"管道与重定向"},{"level":2,"text":"TTY 检测","id":"tty-检测"},{"level":2,"text":"流式处理与缓冲","id":"流式处理与缓冲"},{"level":2,"text":"结构化输出","id":"结构化输出"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"参数解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/foundations/argument-parsing"},"next":{"title":"错误处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/foundations/error-handling"}}